              "name": "Trust Is Not Just About Products, But Also About Attitude.",
              "fill": "#000000ff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": 869.4267578125,
              "height": 300.5211486816406,
              "content": "Trust  Is Not Just \nAbout Products, But \nAlso About Attitude.",
              "lineHeight": 1.3333333333333333,
              "fontFamily": "Limelight",
              "fontSize": 72,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "J1sBT",
              "x": 1022.015625,
              "y": 416.6044921875,
              "name": "We Understand That In The Fiercely Competitive Engineering And Construction Industry, Trust Matters More Than Promises. Busrom Has Earned Its Reputation Through High-Standard Manufacturing, Reliable Delivery, And Continuous Improvement. Every Product We Deliver Stands As A Testament To Our Commitment To Responsibility.",
